				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-027520d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="027520d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>SCN2A is the name of a gene that is commonly associated with early-onset epilepsy and is a leading monogenetic cause of autism spectrum disorder.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6a05239 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="6a05239" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="icon-list.default">
