			<h4 class="ld-fh-element d-inline-block pos-rel  elementor-heading-title lqd-highlight-classic lqd-highlight-grow-left h4"  > EL-PFDD Meeting</h4>		</div>

						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b924f12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b924f12" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>We are pleased to announce the FamilieSCN2A Foundation will host an Externally-led Patient-Focused Drug Development (EL-PFDD) meeting on Friday, October 23, 2026. The goal of this public meeting is to share the critical patient voice for future drug development efforts and key stakeholders, including the US Food and Drug Administration (FDA).</p>								</div>
				</div>
